{"data": [{"author_id": "2055926930915172352", "created_at": "2026-11-10T08:45:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120075298041741426"], "id": "2120075298041741426", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 340, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "收盘复盘｜科技双线爆发，权重持续抽血，极致结构性行情上演！\n\n午后科技接力走强，赚钱效应进一步扩散：创业板摸到2500关口，收+1.69%；全市场4067只个股上涨，85家涨停，无跌停。但上证50逆势收绿-0.37%，和创业板形成超2个点的剪刀差，典型「科技抢筹、红利权重被抽血」格局。\n\n📊指数概况", "url": "https://x.com/TangtangFacai/status/2120075298041741426"}, {"author_id": "2055926930915172352", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:52:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120318698716282912"], "id": "2120318698716282912", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 110, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026年11月11日A股开盘前瞻｜昨日指数全线收涨，隔夜美股仅作联动参考，不预判今日涨跌\n\n本文仅整理昨日收盘、隔夜外盘、官方统计数据，只陈述事实，不给出买卖建议。美元、人民币两种口径进出口数据严格分开，科创50与科创综指互不混用。\n\n一、11月10日A股正式收盘数据", "url": "https://x.com/TangtangFacai/status/2120318698716282912"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-11T02:46:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120347506064392192"], "id": "2120347506064392192", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 583, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "沪指低开0.22%、创业板低开0.17%翻红涨0.5%——今天开盘这半小时，是一个板块在硬扛全场\n\n▪️ 三大指数：分化得厉害", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2120347506064392192"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-10T06:32:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120041968906723660"], "id": "2120041968906723660", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 847, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "午后科技接棒、个股反而涨开了：创指2500拿下+1.69%，全市场4067只票在涨、85家涨停，上证50却翻绿-0.37%\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2120041968906723660"}, {"author_id": "137332930", "created_at": "2026-11-10T07:45:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120056003190227011", "2120060242386178169"], "id": "2120060242386178169", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6869, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "A股盘中 11月10日 复盘，请和A股盘前预测对战：", "url": "https://x.com/cnfinancewatch/status/2120060242386178169"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-10T02:57:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119987693887357403"], "id": "2119987693887357403", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 810, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 开盘半小时 | 三大指数集体高开，创业板指开涨2.44%后回落至+1.71%，高开就是最高点？\n\n▪️", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2119987693887357403"}, {"author_id": "2024254964324061186", "created_at": "2026-11-10T00:57:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119957505615045058"], "id": "2119957505615045058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "模型今天看上证收不上 20 日线，但沪深300 收红｜本周 2/2，上周 8/10\n\n昨天两市缩量。上证涨 0.32% 收 3660.79，成交额只有前 5 天均值的 0.78 倍；沪深300 涨 0.05%，0.71 倍；创业板跌 0.27%。全 A 2242 家涨、3148 家跌，跌停只有 2 家。\n\n上证要收上 20 日线，今天得涨约 0.54%（门槛约", "url": "https://x.com/Sylar76529/status/2119957505615045058"}, {"author_id": "2024254964324061186", "created_at": "2026-11-11T01:06:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120322283894104353"], "id": "2120322283894104353", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "模型今天看上证和沪深300 都收不上 20 日线｜本周 4/4，上周 8/10\n\n昨天个股很热闹，指数几乎没动。全 A 4273 家涨、1149 家跌，涨停 96、跌停只有 1 家，中位数 +1.31%。上证却只涨 0.08% 收 3663.72，沪深300 涨 0.07%。创业板倒是涨了 1.46%，中证1000 涨 1.22%，已经站上 20 日线。", "url": "https://x.com/Sylar76529/status/2120322283894104353"}, {"author_id": "2055926930915172352", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:55:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120440272186384789"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/P6s5RIm8qe", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TangtangFacai/status/2120440272186384789/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120440261247725568", "start": 110, "url": "https://t.co/P6s5RIm8qe"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/P6s5RIm8qe", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TangtangFacai/status/2120440272186384789/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120440261310636032", "start": 110, "url": "https://t.co/P6s5RIm8qe"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/P6s5RIm8qe", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TangtangFacai/status/2120440272186384789/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120440261277073408", "start": 110, "url": "https://t.co/P6s5RIm8qe"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/P6s5RIm8qe", "end": 133, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TangtangFacai/status/2120440272186384789/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120440261268688896", "start": 110, "url": "https://t.co/P6s5RIm8qe"}]}, "id": "2120440272186384789", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 111, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "同样是收涨，今天的盘面数据要分清口径，别被混在一起的成交额绕晕🔥\n\n11月11日周三收盘情况：\n上证指数3680.64点，+0.46%；深成指11389.74点，+1.32%；创业板指2572.07点，大涨3.11%。 https://t.co/P6s5RIm8qe", "url": "https://x.com/TangtangFacai/status/2120440272186384789"}, {"author_id": "1852959373108424704", "created_at": "2026-11-11T10:29:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120463970616414593"], "id": "2120463970616414593", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 137, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📰GS 中国市场综述\n\n📊指数表现\nSCHOM +0.46% 科创 50 +2.80%\n上证 50 -0.27% 创业板指 +3.11%\n沪深 300 指数 +0.41% 中证 500 指数 +1.01%\n中国 A 股总成交额：1.69 万亿元人民币\n💡盘面解读\n中国市场今日反弹，午后突然走强，但没有明确的催化因素。CPO", "url": "https://x.com/BoosKrabs/status/2120463970616414593"}, {"author_id": "1380720896038424579", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:31:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120162453527159013"], "id": "2120162453527159013", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 771, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11月10市场复盘：", "url": "https://x.com/suyu2018block/status/2120162453527159013"}, {"author_id": "137332930", "created_at": "2026-11-11T06:55:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120410027118989511"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 31, "start": 28, "tag": "结论"}]}, "id": "2120410027118989511", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 11811, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股盘中｜2026-11-11 北京时间14:30\n\n #结论", "url": "https://x.com/cnfinancewatch/status/2120410027118989511"}, {"author_id": "2107689248782716928", "created_at": "2026-11-11T09:29:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120448756080689462"], "id": "2120448756080689462", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 187, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "2026年11月11日A股盘后复盘\n指数与量能\n三大指数集体收涨，创业板领跑，成长风格明显占优。 \n•  上证指数：3680.64点，+0.46%\n•  深证成指：11389.74点，+1.32%\n•  创业板指：2572.07点，+3.11%（最强）\n•  科创50：1300.38点，+2.80%\n•  沪深300：4075.71点，+0.41%", "url": "https://x.com/zzzzd6bh/status/2120448756080689462"}, {"author_id": "2055926930915172352", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:59:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120320387733217561"], "id": "2120320387733217561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 116, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "所有人都盯着隔夜美股大跌，等着A股跟着低开，我只整理客观数据，不猜今天开盘涨跌！\n\n1. A股昨日收盘实况（11.10）\n上证3663.72点，小幅收涨0.08%；创业板大涨1.46%，分化极其明显。\n两市成交1.50万亿，较前一日放量222亿元，仅统计沪深两市，不混入三市成交额口径。", "url": "https://x.com/TangtangFacai/status/2120320387733217561"}, {"author_id": "2850084973", "created_at": "2026-11-11T07:23:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120417220857880852"], "id": "2120417220857880852", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 172, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "收评：全线大反攻！创业板大涨3%，沪指时隔29日重新站上20日线\n\n今天A股终于迎来久违的集体反弹，市场做多情绪全面回暖。各大指数全线拉升，创业板大涨超3%，沪指成功收复关键压力位，重新站上20日均线，走出了近期最强的修复行情。\n\n从盘面热点来看，今天市场主线非常明确：超跌科技题材集体爆发。", "url": "https://x.com/naruha7007/status/2120417220857880852"}, {"author_id": "1634530036152963072", "created_at": "2026-11-11T12:48:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120498902952759545"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LQ7nXNt0UL", "end": 176, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/maobidao/status/2120498902952759545/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120498373056937985", "start": 153, "url": "https://t.co/LQ7nXNt0UL"}]}, "id": "2120498902952759545", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 326, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "创业板指一天拉了 3.11%，同一天里沪深300 只涨了 0.41%，两头硬生生撕开 2.7 个百分点的口子。\n\n一边是赛道股全面回血，另一边是传统白马在水下趴着，场内资金显然在把防守盘抽出来，往高弹性的成长方向搬家。\n\n1、今天这根阳线最有意思的地方在量能。两市成交 16763 亿，沪市占了 7362 https://t.co/LQ7nXNt0UL", "url": "https://x.com/maobidao/status/2120498902952759545"}, {"author_id": "2850084973", "created_at": "2026-11-10T07:19:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120053644871823444"], "id": "2120053644871823444", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 866, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "收评：缩量冲高回落！20日线压力凸显，两大中线机会重点锁定\n\n今天A股整体延续高开低走、缩量震荡的格局，盘面分化非常极致。隔夜外围回暖带动早盘高开，但场内增量资金严重不足，指数冲高乏力，沪指再度冲击20日均线失败，全天缩量调整，结构性行情特征十分明显。", "url": "https://x.com/naruha7007/status/2120053644871823444"}, {"author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-11-10T08:23:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120069713074254202"], "id": "2120069713074254202", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天A股最值得发X的一句话：指数在“装死”，个股在“蹦迪”。\n\n沪指只涨了 0.08%，收在3663点，看起来像什么都没发生。但底下是 超4200只个股上涨、95只涨停，创业板指涨了 1.46%，科创综指涨 1.28%。这不是普涨，这是一次极其剧烈的结构换防。\n\n谁在涨：AI应用 + 机器人 + 光通信。", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2120069713074254202"}, {"author_id": "304165652", "created_at": "2026-11-10T06:34:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120042508810158305"], "id": "2120042508810158305", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 402, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "多家券商给A股配置支招，“阶段低点”或已过去，“大级别底部”仍待确认\n\n财联社11月10日讯（记者 陈俊兰）经历前期持续调整后，A股市场近期出现阶段性反弹，市场对于底部是否已经形成、反弹能否进一步演绎为趋势性行情的讨论再度升温。", "url": "https://x.com/najoygo/status/2120042508810158305"}, {"author_id": "2060298489305890816", "created_at": "2026-11-11T06:56:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120410197294514259"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8RDGO5kw2N", "end": 61, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2120410197294514259/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120410184455749632", "start": 38, "url": "https://t.co/8RDGO5kw2N"}]}, "id": "2120410197294514259", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天这盘面，我最大的感受就一句话：指数看着没劲，底下其实已经“换了天地”。 https://t.co/8RDGO5kw2N", "url": "https://x.com/my2026vpn/status/2120410197294514259"}, {"author_id": "1996551578187436033", "created_at": "2026-11-11T06:35:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120405099977834752"], "id": "2120405099977834752", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 945, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "午评里给的B剧本五条全中：沪指3682.50(+0.51%)、创业板2571.84(+3.10%)，PCB把\"独苗\"接成了两条腿", "url": "https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2120405099977834752"}, {"author_id": "1944775093676077056", "created_at": "2026-11-10T08:46:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120075611813060817"], "id": "2120075611813060817", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 741, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "11月10日